{
  "_doc": [
    "Reviewed classification of every Pi and LiteLLM provider against lm15 (tools/provider_landscape.py).",
    "status: supported | partial | missing | out-of-scope | not-a-provider. supported/partial list the lm15 provider strings",
    "(spec/support-matrix.json) that serve the service; partial needs a note and may carry model_rules [glob, lm15 provider]",
    "matched against upstream model ids in order. out-of-scope and not-a-provider need a note. `service` groups ids across",
    "the two libraries in the report; `distinct_from` silences the stale-name check for a provider that only shares a name.",
    "Upstream providers that offer only surfaces lm15 rules out are classified automatically and need no entry.",
    "Classification is judgment over upstream listings, not live evidence; support claims live in the support matrix."
  ],
